'''Shipyards''' were massive facilities that constructed [[starship]]s of various sizes. The [[planet]] [[Rendili]] had an extensive system of smaller shipyards scattered across the [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]] and [[Outer Rim Territories]] that gave it a temporary ascendancy after the [[First Battle of Geonosis]].<ref name="CV NE">''[[Star Wars Complete Vehicles, New Edition]]''</ref> During the [[High Republic Era]] by the year [[232 BBY]],<ref name="Date">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]'' dates the events of ''[[The High Republic: Light of the Jedi]]'' to [[232 BBY]].</ref> the [[Republic shipyards]] are operated by the [[Galactic Republic]] on the [[Core Worlds]] [[planet]]<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref> [[Hosnian Prime]] to build the [[Longbeam-class corvette|Longbeam cruiser]] ''[[Aurora IX]]'', for the use within the [[Republic Defense Coalition]].<ref name="Light of the Jedi">''[[The High Republic: Light of the Jedi]]''</ref> The planet [[Anaxes]] was home to a [[Anaxes shipyards|shipyard facility]] that provided the [[Galactic Republic]] with [[warship]]s during the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="The Bad Batch">{{TCW|The Bad Batch (episode)}}</ref> During the [[Galactic Civil War]], the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] [[Bombing of the Kuat shipyards|bombed]] the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Kuat shipyards|shipyards]] at [[Kuat]].<ref name="Skywalker Strikes, Part IV">[[Star Wars (2015) 4|''Star Wars'' (2015) 4]]</ref> The [[First Order]], after murdering one of its [[Unidentified human male (Fondor)|inhabitants]] took over the [[Fondor Shipyards|shipyards]] orbiting [[Fondor]].<ref name="Allegiance 2">[[Allegiance 2|''Allegiance'' 2]]</ref>

